.TH AX25CHAT 1 "September 2026" "AX25Chat" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ax25chat \- packet radio chat and APRS over AX.25 with a built-in Dire Wolf modem
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ax25chat
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB\-\-call\fR \fICALL\fR]
[\fB\-\-modem\-conf\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB\-\-no\-modem\fR]
[\fB\-\-style\fR \fINAME\fR]
[\fB\-\-list\-styles\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ax25chat
is a chat application for amateur packet radio. It exchanges text in AX.25
UI frames on an unproto destination, sends and receives APRS messages with
acknowledgements and retries, decodes APRS positions, objects, items, status
and weather reports, reports its own position from fixed coordinates or a
GPS receiver, and can beacon periodically. The modem is Dire Wolf, compiled
into the program: a sound card and a PTT line are all the hardware needed.
.PP
The modem is configured through a Dire Wolf configuration file
(\fIdirewolf.conf\fR) selected in the Configuration tab; a starter file is
written to \fI~/.config/AX25Chat/\fR on the first run. The application
settings are kept in \fI~/.config/AX25Chat/config.json\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config " PATH"
Use this settings file instead of the default.
.TP
.BI \-\-call " CALL"
Override the callsign for this run, e.g. MYCALL\-7.
.TP
.BI \-\-modem\-conf " PATH"
Use this Dire Wolf configuration file for the built-in modem.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-modem
Do not start the modem at launch, even if configured to.
.TP
.BI \-\-style " NAME"
Force a Qt style for this run, for example Fusion.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-styles
Print the Qt styles available on this machine and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the command line help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AX25CHAT_STYLE
A Qt style to use, overridden by \fB\-\-style\fR and overriding the saved
setting.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/AX25Chat/config.json
Application settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/AX25Chat/direwolf.conf
Default modem configuration file.
.TP
.I /usr/share/ax25chat/data/
Device identification (tocalls.yaml) and symbol tables used by the decoders.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR direwolf (1)
